Haye Hassan Mujtaba as Haye Hassan Mujtaba as. (2)<br>
<br>
Hogai Tum Par Jafaa Haye Hassan Mujtaba as<br>
<br>
1.Jaada Ne Kaisa Ghazab Dhaaya Hai Ye Aap Par.<br>
<br>
Zehre Sitam Dediya, Haye Hassan Mujtaba as.<br>
<br>
2.Zehre Dagha Ka Asar Aap Pe Aisa Huwa.<br>
<br>
Tukde Jigar Hagaya, Haye Hassan Mujtaba as.<br>
<br>
3.Rote Hain Behad Hussain as Karte Hain Rokar Ye Bain.<br>
<br>
Haye Re Bhayya, Mera Haye Hassan Mujtaba as.<br>
<br>
4.Teer E Jafaa Bhi Chale Aap Ke Taboot Par.<br>
<br>
Zulm Ye Kaisa Huwa, Haye Hassan Mujtaba as.<br>
<br>
5.Zainab E Dilgeer Bhi Rotee Hai Sar Peetkar.<br>
<br>
Deti Hai Rokar Sada, Haye Hassan Mujtaba as.<br>
<br>
6.Anjuman E Asghari Karti Hai Maatam Tera.<br>
<br>
Karte Hain Aarif Bukaa, Haye Hassan Mujtaba as.<br>
<br>
<br>
<br>
(Mohammed Ali Arif)